  "question": {
    "text": "The figure shows a square loop<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>PQRS</mi></math> with an edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>. The resistance of the wire <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQR</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> and that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PSR</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></math>. The value of the magnetic field at the centre of the loop is found to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, then what is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dddw323.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 180px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The magnetic field due to a straight current-carrying wire is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>PQR</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>PSR</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>PQR</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>PSR</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
